  unitName: Zazabis
  unitId: 40094
  unitNumber: 367
  description: The evolved form of a Ziz that absorbed the power from a dragon it
    consumed. It looks completely different from before, and its huge wings greatly
    increase its flying ability. In addition, it also has the tough scales and sharp
    claws of a dragon. Its thunder attack is even more powerful than Ziz's and its
    area of attack is much wider than before. It's said that once you're targeted
    by Zazabis, there's nowhere to run and hide.
  summonDesc: I was summoned?<br>Let me test your strength<br>to see if it is real!
  fusionDesc: Summoner!<br>Check out my thunder strike!<br>It's more powerful than
    ever!
  evoDesc: Summoner! Look!<br>My wings are so beautiful!<br>I'll show you my new
    power!
  element: 4
  rarity: 4
